// ============================================================
// snake.zy — entry point, English
//
// The two entry points differ only in the locale they preselect.
// This decides which language the first screen comes up in, not
// which language the game is played in.
//
//   zymbol run snake.zy
//
// ES: snake.zy — punto de entrada, inglés. Los dos puntos de
// entrada solo se diferencian en el idioma que preseleccionan.
//
//   zymbol run snake.zy
// ============================================================

<# ./juego => juego

juego::iniciar("en")
